#. Preview: https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/GnomeVideoEffects/Effects#kaleidoscope
#: effects/kaleidoscope.effect.desktop.in:4
msgid "Kaleidoscope"
msgstr "কেলিডোস্কৌপ"

