#. Preview: https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/GnomeVideoEffects/Effects#mirror
#: effects/mirror.effect.desktop.in:4
msgid "Mirror"
msgstr "আইনা"

#: effects/mirror.effect.desktop.in:5
