#. Preview: https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/GnomeVideoEffects/Effects#noir
#: effects/noir.effect.desktop.in:4
msgid "Noir/Blanc"
msgstr "নোয়েৰ/ব্লেঙ্ক"

#: effects/noir.effect.desktop.in:5
msgid "Transform video input into grayscale"
