#. Preview: https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/GnomeVideoEffects/Effects#twirl
#: effects/twirl.effect.desktop.in:4
msgid "Twirl"
msgstr "টুইৰ্ল"

#: effects/twirl.effect.desktop.in:5
msgid "Twirl the center of the video"
